# Manual API checks – Rider: run the API with the "https" profile, then click ▶ next to a request.
# Rider's HTTP client keeps cookies between requests, like a browser.

@host = https://localhost:7283

### Public – is the API alive?
GET {{host}}/health

### Not signed in yet → 401
GET {{host}}/api/me

### Sign in as a persona (dev only). "private" = your own data from the Worker (dev:private)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/dev/private

### Who am I? → id, provider "dev", name
GET {{host}}/api/me

### Sign out
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout

### After sign-out → 401 again
GET {{host}}/api/me
